/**
 * Curated model catalog: maps Higgsfield-style display names to OpenRouter slugs
 * and encodes each model's real, *verified* constraints so the UI never offers
 * an option the provider will reject.
 *
 * Sources: live `GET https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models` (Aug 29 2026) and
 * end-to-end tests recorded in the openrouter-image-gen / openrouter-video-gen skills.
 * `verified: false` means the slug is live on OpenRouter but its option ranges are
 * best-effort; the server surfaces the provider's 400 body verbatim so the user
 * can see the supported values.
 */
